        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I've added special support to 'exs' extension as it seems that built-in `vim.filetype.match()` indeed doesn't differentiate between 'ex' and 'exs' (because there is no dedicated 'elixirscript' filetype, it seems). So this is similar to a precedent of 'h' extension.\r\n\r\nThanks for bringing this up!",
